# Without this file, setuptools' default sdist file-finder pulls in
# tests/test_*.py individually (matching its built-in test-file heuristic)
# but not tests/__init__.py, tests/fixtures/, or the tests/fortran_parity/,
# tests/integration/, tests/validation/ subpackages -- an sdist a user
# actually tried to test from would fail on the first import. None of it is
# runnable from an sdist anyway (vendor/ and the fixture data it needs
# aren't shipped either), so exclude the whole tree rather than ship a
# partial, broken copy.
prune tests

include CHANGELOG.md
